 So in summary you can access any of the models from Amazon or third party model providers through just an API.

22
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
 Now the good thing about Amazon better office is a fully managed serverless service from AWS.

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:44,000
 So what it means is that for all the models that are available as part of Amazon bedrock, AWS will take care of hosting the model monitoring, scaling, patching and everything else related to infrastructure.

24
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:51,000
 So all you need to do is just make an API call to the Amazon bedrock with your user input and you will get a response.

25
00:02:51,000 --> 00:03:00,000
 And most importantly you will only be charged for the number of API calls you make. So if you don't make any API calls you don't incur any charges.

26
